  "details": "While grabbing a Physbone, Physbone colliders are ignoring its capsule segment as if the setting \"Bones As Sphere\" was enabled on the collider.\n\nSee attached video:\n\nOn my left hand I added two colliders for the Physbone on my right hand.\n\nThe upper collider has the \"Bones As Sphere\" option unchecked.\n\nThe lower collider has the \"Bones As Sphere\" option checked.\n\nWhile not grabbing the Physbone it behaves as expected and is colliding with it's middle segment.\n\nWhen I grab the Physbone with my left hand it is only colliding on it's end point, which I would expect only if I had the \"Bones As Sphere\" option checked on the upper Physbone.",
